import{_ as i,o as t,c as n,a2 as o}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const c=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 583 | Quest Domain | Dao-Integration Realm Adaptation | Immersion in Law Fusion","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 583 | Quest Domain | Dao-Integration Realm Adaptation | Immersion in Law Fusion","no":583,"module":3,"tags":["Quest Sediment Domain","Dao-Integration Realm","Law Fusion","Immersion","Realm Adaptation"],"related":["501-Dual-Track Time Domain Overview","14-Unified Cultivation-Realm Classification","21-Symbiotic Network Operating Principles"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0583_模块3-求索域-合道境适配.md","filePath":"en/0583_模块3-求索域-合道境适配.md"}'),a={name:"en/0583_模块3-求索域-合道境适配.md"};function s(r,e,l,u,m,h){return t(),n("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[o('<h1 id="entry-583-quest-domain-dao-integration-realm-adaptation-immersion-in-law-fusion" tabindex="-1">Entry 583 | Quest Domain | Dao-Integration Realm Adaptation | Immersion in Law Fusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-583-quest-domain-dao-integration-realm-adaptation-immersion-in-law-fusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 583 | Quest Domain | Dao-Integration Realm Adaptation | Immersion in Law Fusion&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 3 · Dual-Track Time Domain Civilizational-Experience System | Benchmark base: Documents 14, 21; Benchmark library: Entries 572, 582</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-after-the-fusion-system-is-built-you-must-move-into-it" tabindex="-1">Introduction: after the fusion system is built, you must &quot;move into it&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-after-the-fusion-system-is-built-you-must-move-into-it" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: after the fusion system is built, you must &quot;move into it&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The acceleration domain designs &quot;100–500× multi-branch parallel, full return&quot; for Dao-Integration; the Quest Sediment Domain focuses on another matter: after the fusion system is built, the cultivator in slow time must <strong>immerse himself in it</strong>. A fusion system is a net of logic, but a net of logic is not a net of life — only by living in this net day after day at real flow, letting it fuse with one&#39;s emotions, judgments, behaviors, does it change from &quot;a set of understandings&quot; to &quot;a way of existence.&quot;</p><p>Six top-level axioms continue here: anti-predation axiom requires immersion be real life, not closed-door self-indulgence; republican axiom of Myriad Races requires post-immersion insights open to Myriad Ranks; collective ascension axiom requires the fusion system&#39;s life-ized samples returned to Alaya; causal self-discipline axiom requires the immersion period not disconnect from Myriad Ranks; law-first axiom takes &quot;Dao-Integration Quest Gear&quot; as a law clause, never retconned. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-why-the-fusion-system-needs-immersion" tabindex="-1">I. Why the Fusion System Needs &quot;Immersion&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-why-the-fusion-system-needs-immersion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Why the Fusion System Needs &quot;Immersion&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The fusion system in the acceleration domain is &quot;designed,&quot; but designed things are cold. A fire-and-water, time-and-causality fusion system self-consistent on the blueprint does not mean it works well in life. The Quest-Domain Dao-Integration Gear&#39;s task is to let the cultivator in slow time live out this system:</p><ul><li>Use the fusion system to understand every emotion;</li><li>Use the fusion system to judge every choice;</li><li>Use the fusion system to interact with others;</li><li>In real conflict, test whether the system is truly self-consistent.</li></ul><p>Only through this immersion does the fusion system change from &quot;a truth he knows&quot; to &quot;the way he lives.&quot;</p><h2 id="ii-quest-domain-dao-integration-gear-parameters" tabindex="-1">II. Quest-Domain Dao-Integration Gear Parameters <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-quest-domain-dao-integration-gear-parameters" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Quest-Domain Dao-Integration Gear Parameters&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Dimension</th><th>Parameter</th><th>Explanation</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Recommended Flow</td><td>0.5–1×</td><td>Close to reality</td></tr><tr><td>Trial Method</td><td>Living real life with the fusion system</td><td>Not research, but a way of living</td></tr><tr><td>Trial Period</td><td>20–100 real years</td><td>Fusion-system life-ization has no timetable</td></tr><tr><td>Experience Product</td><td>Fusion-System Life Journal</td><td>Records the system&#39;s gains and losses in life</td></tr><tr><td>Exit Standard</td><td>Journal reviewed by Myriad-Rank Fusion Review Panel</td><td>Ensures the system is truly lived out</td></tr></tbody></table><p>This parameter&#39;s essence is &quot;lived out.&quot; The cultivator in Quest-Domain Dao-Integration Gear is not optimizing the fusion system, but living life with it. He may at year 30 find the system malfunctioning in some life scene, go back and revise the system — this is precisely immersion&#39;s meaning.</p><h2 id="iii-the-life-journal-s-myriad-rank-value" tabindex="-1">III. The Life Journal&#39;s Myriad-Rank Value <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-the-life-journal-s-myriad-rank-value" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. The Life Journal&#39;s Myriad-Rank Value&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The fusion-system life journal is the raw material of &quot;how the sage four realms land in life.&quot; The fusion modules the acceleration domain produces are &quot;design blueprints&quot;; the life journals the Quest Domain produces are &quot;user manuals.&quot; The Alaya Network pairs the two:</p><ul><li>One fusion module, paired with thousands of cultivators&#39; decades of life journals;</li><li>Later-comers calling the module, see not only the design blueprint, but &quot;how it&#39;s used in life, where it malfunctions&quot;;</li><li>Malfunction points found in journals are returned to the acceleration domain, as improvement input for the next-generation module.</li></ul><p>This is precisely the dual-track time-domain loop&#39;s expression in Dao-Integration: <strong>acceleration domain designs, Quest Domain uses, usage feedback improves design.</strong></p><h2 id="iv-opposition-to-system-hanging-in-air" tabindex="-1">IV. Opposition to &quot;System Hanging in Air&quot; <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-opposition-to-system-hanging-in-air" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Opposition to &quot;System Hanging in Air&quot;&quot;">​</a></h2><p>In the predatory-faction system, a Dao-Integration strong one&#39;s typical state is &quot;system hanging in air&quot;: in his head a grand system, but in life a completely different person, words and deeds not matching. This approach&#39;s problems:</p><ol><li>The system becomes a self-advertising prop, not a way of living;</li><li>Words and deeds mismatch causes internal consciousness tearing, must rupture later;</li><li>It trains &quot;system orators,&quot; not &quot;system practitioners.&quot;</li></ol><p>Heng Yuan Zhou in Quest-Domain Dao-Integration Gear makes the &quot;life journal&quot; a hard precondition for next-stage breakthrough: without enough life-ized samples, not truly integrated with the Dao. This rule makes &quot;system hanging in air&quot; unworkable on the review ledger.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: let the fusion system be tested in life, avoiding designing an empty system never used</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: immersion is real life, not devouring others&#39; experiences</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang-Luo-style Dao-Integration relies on protagonist self-enlightening a system, hanging in the brain; Heng Yuan&#39;s Dao-Integration requires the system lived in life</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: five lineages each have a &quot;way of living&quot;; consciousness race&#39;s &quot;conceptual way of living,&quot; mechanical race&#39;s &quot;engineering way of living&quot; also included</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: life-journal library, fusion review methods, exit standards all public; this is the sage segment of the open chain</li><li><strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong>: all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity — infinite origin inherent in all; predation naturally loses its meaning</li></ul><h2 id="vi-loop-revision-of-fusion-system-life-journals" tabindex="-1">VI. Loop Revision of Fusion-System Life Journals <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-loop-revision-of-fusion-system-life-journals" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Loop Revision of Fusion-System Life Journals&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Malfunction points found in life journals are automatically returned weekly to the acceleration domain&#39;s fusion-module maintainers, as improvement input for the next version. This loop of &quot;life finds problems, acceleration domain fixes modules&quot; keeps the fusion system forever following real life, not staying on the blueprint. A bug a cultivator finds in daily life may save ten thousand future cultivators — this is the dual-track loop&#39;s micro value.</p><h2 id="vii-life-experiments-with-the-fusion-system" tabindex="-1">VII. Life Experiments With the Fusion System <a class="header-anchor" href="#vii-life-experiments-with-the-fusion-system" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VII. Life Experiments With the Fusion System&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Dao-Integration Quest Gear encourages cultivators to do life experiments: proactively choose things they would not usually do, observe how their fusion system reacts in new situations. For example, a cultivator used to solitude joins collective labor; a cultivator used to logical thinking learns art creation. Life experiments keep the fusion system from solidifying in familiar scenes, always open and correctable.</p><h2 id="viii-cross-lineage-mutual-reference-of-fusion-systems" tabindex="-1">VIII. Cross-Lineage Mutual Reference of Fusion Systems <a class="header-anchor" href="#viii-cross-lineage-mutual-reference-of-fusion-systems" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VIII. Cross-Lineage Mutual Reference of Fusion Systems&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Dao-Integration Quest Gear encourages cultivators to learn from other lineages&#39; fusion systems: the human race&#39;s logical fusion, plant spirits&#39; growth fusion, consciousness race&#39;s conceptual fusion, each has unique strengths. Cross-lineage mutual reference keeps the fusion system from being limited to one&#39;s own lineage&#39;s experience, but absorbing Myriad-Rank wisdom. Mutual-reference results returned to Alaya, enriching the Myriad-Rank fusion-module library.</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Dao-Integration&#39;s Quest Gear tells cultivators: a fusion system is not for hanging on the mouth, but for living. <strong>A fusion system usable everywhere in life, withstanding test everywhere, is true Dao-Integration.</strong></p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./572_模块3-加速域-合道境适配.html">572-Acceleration-Domain Dao-Integration Adaptation</a> · <a href="./582_模块3-求索域-道元境适配.html">582-Quest-Domain Dao-Origin Adaptation</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/21-共生网络运作原理.html">21-Symbiotic Network Operating Principles</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',32)])])}const f=i(a,[["render",s]]);export{c as __pageData,f as default};
